    <div class="htext">
      <h1>Better days are coming.</h1>
      <p>Charles Ward left school early, found personal development in 2019 and went on to earn a business degree. Now he speaks from the heart about choosing change, facing fear and being a light for people in a dark place.</p>
      <div class="btns">
        <a class="btn" href="#podcast">Watch the first episode</a>
