<div class="strip">CHARLES WARD 365<small>PODCAST &middot; BELIEVE AND ACHIEVE</small></div>

<main>
<section id="story">
  <div class="wrap about">
    <img class="portrait" id="p2" alt="Charles Ward smiling in the studio">
    <div>
      <h2>From restless to rising</h2>
      <p class="lead">Charles didn't suffer from depression. He suffered from boredom: getting up, getting by, with no structure and no direction. Then one decision changed the way he thought about everything.</p>
      <ul class="tl">
        <li><b>School years</b><span>He left school after fourth year. Restless, often in the principal's office and not challenged by the classroom.</span></li>
        <li><b>2019</b><span>A friend's recommendation led him to a book on persistence. He wasn't a reader, but one idea stuck: if you decide to change, you can.</span></li>
        <li><b>Back to education</b><span>He set his first real goals, started an advanced business course, then completed a four-year degree in business, marketing and sales.</span></li>
        <li><b>Final year</b><span>Life interrupted his last semester. He came back the following year, finished, and graduated with a 2:1.</span></li>
        <li><b>Today</b><span>He's building toward a life of service as a speaker and host, and doing it for his family and the next generation.</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="talks" id="speaking">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Talks from lived experience</h2>
    <p class="lead">Charles speaks from the heart, from experience and from love. Each talk gives your audience one clear shift to make.</p>
    <div class="talkgrid">
      <div class="talk"><h3>False Evidence Appearing Real</h3><p>Fear and the stories we tell ourselves. How limiting beliefs form, and how to step past them. Includes his walk across hot coals.</p></div>
      <div class="talk"><h3>Turn the M Upside Down</h3><p>From "me" to "we". Why networking, mentors and community matter, and why one person who sees what you can't see can change your life.</p></div>
      <div class="talk"><h3>Don't Wait Until Monday</h3><p>Take action now. Persistence, self-talk and starting today, whether it's a business, a diet or going back to school.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="podcast">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Charles Ward 365 Podcast</h2>
    <p class="lead">Believe and achieve. Charles's first conversation was recorded at Tune Community Radio with host Damian Quinn. Follow along for new episodes.</p>
